' New #{@feedback.feedback_type.titleize} Submission
= "\r\n" * 2
' A new #{@feedback.feedback_type} has been submitted through the website:
= "\r\n" * 2
' SUBMISSION DETAILS
' ==================
' Name: #{@feedback.name}
' Email: #{@feedback.email}
' Type: #{@feedback.feedback_type.titleize}
' Submitted: #{@feedback.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p")}
= "\r\n" * 2
' CONTENT
' =======
#{@feedback.content}
= "\r\n" * 2
- if @feedback.image.attached?
  ' ATTACHED IMAGE
  ' ==============
  ' Filename: #{@feedback.image.filename}
  ' Size: #{number_to_human_size(@feedback.image.byte_size)}
  ' Content Type: #{@feedback.image.content_type}
  = "\r\n" * 2
' This feedback was submitted through the Baldrick Boards website feedback form.
' Please review and consider featuring it on the appropriate page.
